[[File:Inside The Actors Studio logo.png|right|250px]]

'''''[[Inside the Actors Studio]]''''' is a series on the [[Bravo (American TV network)|Bravo]] [[cable television]] channel, first hosted by [[James Lipton]] from 1994 to 2018, and on [[Ovation (American TV channel)|Ovation]] for the show's 23rd and final season in 2019 with an alternating list of hosts. It is produced and directed by Jeff Wurtz; the executive producer is James Lipton. The program, which premiered in 1994, is distributed internationally by CABLEready and is broadcast in 125 countries around the world reaching 89,000,000 homes.<ref name=ms>{{cite web |title=Lipton takes readers inside 'Inside the Actors Studio'  |url=https://www.nbcnews.com/id/wbna21340777 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20071024012939/http://today.msnbc.msn.com/id/21340777/ |url-status=live |archive-date=October 24, 2007 |date=Oct 19, 2007 |publisher=[[Msnbc.com]] }}</ref> It is currently taped at the [[Michael Schimmel Center for the Arts]] at [[Pace University]]'s [[New York City]] campus.<ref name=s>{{cite news |title=All the School's a Stage; Stars Talk Shop and the Film Community Listens|author=WARREN BERGER |url=https://www.nytimes.com/1999/03/14/tv/all-the-school-s-a-stage-stars-talk-shop-and-the-film-community-listens.html |newspaper=[[The New York Times]] |date=March 14, 1999}}</ref><ref name=ny>{{cite news |title=The Studio, A Place Of Legends|author= JAMES BARRON|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1996/09/22/tv/the-studio-a-place-of-legends.html |newspaper=[[The New York Times]] |date= September 22, 1996 }}</ref><ref>{{cite book |title= Stanislavsky in focus: an acting master for the twenty-first century|last=Carnicke |first=Sharon Marie |year=2008 |publisher=Taylor & Francis (Routledge)|isbn=978-0-415-77496-3 |page=52 |url=https://books.google.com/books?id=gM6d8UpwkjwC&dq=Inside+The+Actors+Studio&pg=PT66 }}</ref>

Many of the available episode guides conflict with one another regarding the numbering of episodes<ref name=ep>{{cite web|url=http://epguides.com/InsidetheActorsStudio/|title=Inside the Actors Studio (a Titles & Air Dates Guide)|publisher=epguides.com|access-date=2011-01-26}}</ref><ref name=imdb>{{cite web|url=https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0169455/episodes|title=Inside the Actors Studio episodes|website=The Internet Movie Database|access-date=2011-01-26}}</ref><ref name=tv>{{cite web|url=http://www.tv.com/inside-the-actors-studio/show/1931/episode.html?tag=list_header;paginator;All&season=All|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20091030030532/http://www.tv.com/inside-the-actors-studio/show/1931/episode.html?season=All&tag=list_header;paginator;All|url-status=dead|archive-date=October 30, 2009|title=Inside the Actors Studio&nbsp;— Episode Guide|publisher=tv.com|access-date=2011-01-26}}</ref> and in some cases are internally inconsistent.<ref name=official>{{cite web|url=http://www.bravotv.com/inside-the-actors-studio|title=Official Site|date=3 August 2007 |publisher=BravoTV.com|access-date=2011-01-26}}</ref>  The numbering here is a complete and internally consistent list created from other available episode guides for the show.

